<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0"><songwriters><songwriter>王以太</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata>
<amll:meta key="musicName" value="时间是金"/>
<amll:meta key="artists" value="王以太"/>
<amll:meta key="album" value="闪火mixtape - EP"/>
<amll:meta key="album" value="闪火mixtape"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6768224290"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:28.628"><div begin="16.484" end="34.306"><p begin="16.484" end="17.545" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.484" end="17.545">时间是金</span></p><p begin="17.592" end="19.173" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.592" end="19.173">会溜走在一个不小心</span></p><p begin="19.229" end="21.365" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.229" end="21.365">脚步轻轻 它不管你听没听见</span></p><p begin="21.414" end="23.434" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.414" end="23.434">日月如梭 这是老人说的经典</span></p><p begin="23.466" end="25.588" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.466" end="25.588">循环播放 摆在桌上的经验</span></p><p begin="25.652" end="27.504" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.652" end="27.504">避免 挥霍过后良心受到评检</span></p><p begin="27.514" end="29.807" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.514" end="29.807">毕竟时针秒针反复交换 绝不留在定点</span></p><p begin="29.817" end="32.008" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.817" end="32.008">我功力 尽显在历练的期间</span></p><p begin="32.066" end="34.306" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.066" end="34.306">沉重的包袱 先上路再精简</span></p></div><div begin="34.259" end="51.478"><p begin="34.259" end="36.114" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.259" end="36.114">时间在帮我上坡</span></p><p begin="35.863" end="38.595" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.863" end="38.595">脚下的泥土翻起波浪 形容说唱圈的动荡</span></p><p begin="38.260" end="40.288" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.260" end="40.288">直觉仍在叫我照做</span></p><p begin="40.097" end="42.883" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.097" end="42.883">左右徘徊躲闪的视线停在镂空表盘的中间</span></p><p begin="42.508" end="44.547" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.508" end="44.547">上帝叫我不要放弃</span></p><p begin="44.403" end="47.096" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.403" end="47.096">时间让你摸爬 滚打 最后岩浆喷发</span></p><p begin="47.106" end="48.388" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.106" end="48.388">爆发意味着胜利</span></p><p begin="48.398" end="51.478" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.398" end="51.478">将军 弹指间 这棋盘变成我的场地</span></p></div><div begin="52.378" end="1:08.647"><p begin="52.378" end="54.376" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.378" end="54.376">当士兵变成将领 生日聚会到了葬礼</span></p><p begin="54.386" end="57.003" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.386" end="57.003">印象深刻到你忘记这是必经历的场景 不是背景</span></p><p begin="57.013" end="1:00.180" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.013" end="1:00.180">无法逃离背弃背离 可是时间还是抓住你的把柄 whoa</span></p><p begin="1:00.190" end="1:02.164" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.190" end="1:02.164">时间就是毒品 逼你染上毒瘾后</span></p><p begin="1:02.174" end="1:04.218" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.174" end="1:04.218">它又伙同欲望一起让处女变苍井空</span></p><p begin="1:04.282" end="1:06.354" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.282" end="1:06.354">我的词句丑陋 是时间让我惹的祸</span></p><p begin="1:06.404" end="1:08.647" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.404" end="1:08.647">为了赢 不然你来告诉我该怎麼做</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.780" end="1:45.477"><p begin="1:08.780" end="1:10.083" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.780" end="1:10.083">求求时间让我不要忘</span></p><p begin="1:10.093" end="1:12.280" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.093" end="1:12.280">让债主撒手不要账 让对手闭嘴不要唱</span></p><p begin="1:12.290" end="1:14.976" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.290" end="1:14.976">喝了毒药 吐掉 时间叫我到了这儿就不要浪</span></p><p begin="1:14.986" end="1:17.190" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.986" end="1:17.190">看到事情不要呛 别人的刀不要挡</span></p><p begin="1:17.370" end="1:19.263" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.370" end="1:19.263">时间狡猾的笑着对倒下的我说</span></p><p begin="1:19.273" end="1:21.425" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.273" end="1:21.425">别等到我走后想起好多利益没收获</span></p><p begin="1:21.435" end="1:23.428" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.435" end="1:23.428">它又催促我站起来 拿起这个麦克风</span></p><p begin="1:23.438" end="1:28.817" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.438" end="1:25.865">但我什麼都听不见 只听见秒针在走动</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:23.523" end="1:28.817">(Ticktock, ticktock, ticktock, ticktock, ticktock)</span></span></p><p begin="1:43.965" end="1:45.477" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.965" end="1:45.477">Time is a fool, yeah</span></p></div><div begin="1:50.242" end="2:02.498"><p begin="1:50.242" end="1:51.812" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.242" end="1:51.812">时间让 伤口发炎</span></p><p begin="1:51.822" end="1:53.374" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.822" end="1:53.374">时间让我沉默寡言</span></p><p begin="1:53.384" end="1:54.907" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.384" end="1:54.907">时间让 人们期待</span></p><p begin="1:54.917" end="1:56.393" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.917" end="1:56.393">时间让 人们离开</span></p><p begin="1:56.403" end="1:59.495" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.403" end="1:59.495">时间让本该蓝色的天充满黑色阴霾</span></p><p begin="1:59.505" end="2:01.000" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.505" end="2:01.000">时间让 情景再现</span></p><p begin="2:01.010" end="2:02.498" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.010" end="2:02.498">但时间也偷换概念</span></p></div><div begin="2:02.508" end="2:14.801"><p begin="2:02.508" end="2:05.581" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.508" end="2:05.581">时间让我变得懦弱 没了当初的勇气</span></p><p begin="2:05.591" end="2:08.601" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.591" end="2:08.601">时间让我变得强壮 并且多了份敌意</span></p><p begin="2:08.611" end="2:11.597" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.611" end="2:11.597">时间让我变得向上 也让我变得堕落</span></p><p begin="2:11.657" end="2:14.801" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.657" end="2:14.801">它让该遇见的遇见 而该错过的错过</span></p></div><div begin="2:14.811" end="2:39.185"><p begin="2:14.811" end="2:17.835" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.811" end="2:17.835">让时间给你答案 但如果 时间错了</span></p><p begin="2:17.845" end="2:20.877" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.845" end="2:20.877">如果时间错了 让你经历不该经历过程</span></p><p begin="2:20.887" end="2:23.887" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.887" end="2:23.887">如果时间错了直接作了不说话的弱者</span></p><p begin="2:23.897" end="2:27.006" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.897" end="2:27.006">你有什麼立场资格把时间的错过问</span></p><p begin="2:27.016" end="2:30.063" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.016" end="2:30.063">老人说姜是老的辣 时间年纪大吧</span></p><p begin="2:30.073" end="2:33.108" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.073" end="2:33.108">让我失去且不怪罪它 时间算奸诈吧</span></p><p begin="2:33.169" end="2:36.179" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.169" end="2:36.179">它狡猾的笑 它狡猾的笑 我很怕它</span></p><p begin="2:36.189" end="2:39.185" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.189" end="2:39.185">它在每个人的口中 长相都不一样吧</span></p></div><div begin="2:39.195" end="2:51.377"><p begin="2:39.195" end="2:42.201" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.195" end="2:42.201">时间差 打个时间差 到底是谁在差</span></p><p begin="2:42.262" end="2:45.240" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.262" end="2:45.240">谁在下面躺了一百年的骸骨被风化</span></p><p begin="2:45.298" end="2:48.282" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.298" end="2:48.282">时间让 刘德华老了 还是刘德华</span></p><p begin="2:48.370" end="2:51.377" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.370" end="2:51.377">但让你从哥哥姐姐 变成了大叔大妈</span></p></div><div begin="2:51.387" end="3:16.771"><p begin="2:51.387" end="2:54.493" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.387" end="2:54.493">笑 笑 笑 你接着笑 时间在回避</span></p><p begin="2:54.537" end="2:57.496" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.537" end="2:57.496">等到步履蹒跚的时候 自己才回忆</span></p><p begin="2:57.506" end="3:00.638" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.506" end="3:00.638">那时我是多麼年轻 多少人被我吸引</span></p><p begin="3:00.648" end="3:03.695" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.648" end="3:03.695">拿着多少万的年薪 有多少动力前进</span></p><p begin="3:03.705" end="3:06.668" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.705" end="3:06.668">闯了祸 时间闯了祸 把我变成现在</span></p><p begin="3:06.678" end="3:09.799" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.678" end="3:09.799">坐摇椅 织毛衣 祈祷明天我还健在</span></p><p begin="3:09.809" end="3:12.675" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.809" end="3:12.675">我付出了时间 但时间又付出个屁</span></p><p begin="3:12.845" end="3:16.771" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.845" end="3:16.771">时间是金 但时间拿走的也很彻底</span></p></div><div begin="3:15.876" end="3:25.546"><p begin="3:15.876" end="3:18.276" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.876" end="3:18.276">It's a war going on outside</span></p><p begin="3:18.286" end="3:19.048" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.286" end="3:19.048">On the corner</span></p><p begin="3:19.058" end="3:21.352" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.058" end="3:21.352">It's a war on your TV screen</span></p><p begin="3:21.362" end="3:22.197" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.362" end="3:22.197">Every morning</span></p><p begin="3:22.207" end="3:24.644" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.207" end="3:24.644">It's a war going on outside</span></p><p begin="3:24.654" end="3:25.546" itunes:key="L70" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.654" end="3:25.546">On the corner</span></p></div></body></tt>